Files adapted from Zombiewood say so in a header comment: cmake/NovaDependencies.cmake, src/core/*,
src/cpu/*, src/loader/*, src/hle/* (the SVC dispatch with FAST and normal handlers, signature-deduced
marshalling, re-entrant call_guest, per-thread JIT, loader bookkeeping).

Dependencies fetched at build time (not vendored):
- dynarmic, azahar-emu fork (0BSD), and its bundled externals: mcl, xbyak, Zydis/Zycore, fmt, robin-map
  (MIT / BSD).
- Boost headers (Boost Software License 1.0) from vcpkg.
- Shipped with the Windows build (vcpkg): SDL3 (zlib License), ANGLE libEGL/libGLESv2 (BSD 3-Clause),
  mimalloc (MIT), zlib (zlib License).
